Wune is an LED audio spectrum visualizer inspired by 80s and 90s
mini-hifi stereo systems.

Features:
- Real-time stereo frequency analysis
- Audio capture via PulseAudio loopback monitors
- Customizable LED shapes, layouts, and colors
- Responsive ballistics and theme presets
- Now Playing track metadata via MPRIS2 (playerctl)
- Window resizing and settings persistence
